1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,180
things slow, intimate, emotional, spoken word, poetry, natural breaths, deliberate line, pauses,

2
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:14,600
gentle emphasis, reflective and warm. I don't chase people anymore. I chase peace.

3
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:22,560
If you stay, I'm grateful. If you leave, I'm still peaceful. Because I finally learned,

4
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:26,440
my worth isn't proven by how hard I'm willing to suffer to be loved.

5
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:30,040
I'm not cold. I'm just kinder to myself.
